    {
      "tag": "a",
      "text": "BLOG"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Ready to Start, Grow, & Scale Your Private Practice With Confidence?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "It's time to ditch the overwhelm and build the profitable, peaceful, fully aligned practice you’ve been dreaming of."
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "text": "Explore the Library"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "IT'S TIME TO DITCH THE OVERWHELM AND BUILD THE PROFITABLE, PEACEFUL, FULLY ALIGNED PRACTICE YOU’VE BEEN DREAMING OF."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Boss Clinician"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Mission"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Helping therapists build profitable practices, embrace confidence, and create a lifestyle filled with freedom, fulfillment, and financial peace."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Explore the Boss Clinician Training Library →"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Created to help therapists step into their CEO identity, attract aligned clients, and run a practice that feels good and grows consistently."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "DIRECTORY MAKEOVER AUDIT"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Make Your Profile Irresistible — Get Seen. Get Chosen. Get Booked."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "A personalized audit that shows you exactly how to transform your Psychology Today or TherapyDen profile into a client-attracting powerhouse."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "You’ll Get:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "text": "Turn My profile into a booking magnet!"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "FULLY BOOKED TOOLKIT"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Confidence. Consistency. Clients — This Toolkit Gets You Booked."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "You worked hard to become a therapist — now let your practice reflect that. The Fully Booked Toolkit is designed to help you attract consistent clients , streamline systems, and run a thriving practice that fills your schedule without chaos."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Inside You’ll Get:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "text": "GET FULLY BOOKED HERE"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "CREDENTIALING SUCCESS FORMULA"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "For Group Practice Owners Who Need Their Team Credentialed ASAP"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "A simple, repeatable system to credential your clinicians quickly and cleanly."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Inside you will get:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "a",
      "text": "Grab Credentialing Success Formula"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "CREDENTIAL WITH CONFIDENCE"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "For Solo Therapists Ready to Start Credentialing"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "No confusion. No overwhelm. Just clear direction."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Inside you will get:"
    },
